# API base URL (baked into production builds).
#
# Development (recommended): leave unset or comment out.
# Vite proxies /api and /ws to http://127.0.0.1:8000 — works from your phone
# when you open http://YOUR_LAN_IP:5173 (same Wi-Fi as this PC).
#
# Production build (Vercel):
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-service.onrender.com
#
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
